    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Four-direction workflow update — 2026-11-23\nFour zone workers: North, East, South, West. Each registered clip is assigned to its jurisdiction worker.\nSupported classes: people, bicycles, cars, motorcycles, buses, and trucks.\nPerson candidates require human confirmation before neighboring-zone follow-up.\nNo face recognition, identity matching, or plate OCR. No detections without registered clips.\nSynthetic four-feed RTX 5050 test passed. Real case footage needs verified camera, direction, recording time/timezone, and provenance.",
        "height": 336
      },
